  "romanized_title": "Stage Behind",
  "description": "Straight-laced honor student Jin-Woo decides to break the rules just once, and steps into a club for the first time in his life. One drunken mistake leads to him spending a passionate night with a strikingly handsome stranger - the next morning, he wakes up alone in an empty room…with a pile of cash on the nightstand. Shocked and humiliated, Jin-Woo assumes the worst, and buries the memory deep in his heart. Back at school, Jin-Woo volunteers for a student performance…only to lock eyes with someone on stage. It’s him. The man from that night, and the king of campus: Kwon Tae-Yeong. It’s then that, in front of everyone and with a glint in his eye, Tae-Yeong smiles and utters two words that will change the course of both of their lives forever: “Found you.” \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
